<dialog class="project-modal" id="modal-grite" aria-labelledby="modal-grite-title">
  <div class="project-modal-inner">
    <button type="button" class="modal-close" data-modal-close aria-label="Close dialog">&times;</button>
    <span class="badge">Business System</span>
    <h3 class="modal-title" id="modal-grite-title">Grite SMS — Stock Management System</h3>

    <h4 class="modal-heading">Overview</h4>
    <p class="modal-text">Grite SMS is a stock management system focused on organizing and managing inventory-related operations for small and growing businesses.</p>

    <h4 class="modal-heading">Problem</h4>
    <p class="modal-text">Manually tracking products, stock levels and sales activity becomes error-prone and time-consuming as a business grows, especially without a centralized system.</p>

    <h4 class="modal-heading">Solution</h4>
    <p class="modal-text">A centralized interface that brings product records, inventory levels and sales activity together in one place, making day-to-day inventory operations easier to manage.</p>

    <h4 class="modal-heading">Main Functionality</h4>
    <ul class="modal-list">
      <li>Product management</li>
      <li>Inventory / stock level tracking</li>
      <li>Sales history</li>
      <li>Search &amp; filtering</li>
      <li>Dashboard overview with reports</li>
    </ul>

    <h4 class="modal-heading">Technology</h4>
    <p class="modal-text">Full technology breakdown for Grite SMS is still being finalized for public write-up — this section will be updated with confirmed stack details.</p>

    <h4 class="modal-heading">Development Challenges</h4>
    <p class="modal-text">Structuring inventory data so product, stock and sales information stay consistent as features were added, and designing an interface that stays usable as the amount of tracked data grows.</p>

    <h4 class="modal-heading">What I Learned</h4>
    <p class="modal-text">Working on Grite SMS reinforced how much data-model decisions shape the front-end experience, and how important it is to design around a business's actual day-to-day workflow rather than feature completeness alone.</p>
  </div>
</dialog>
<dialog class="project-modal" id="modal-touchtech" aria-labelledby="modal-touchtech-title">
