    <p class="modal-text">TouchTech Hub is a responsive e-commerce interface designed to make product discovery and purchasing simple.</p>

    <h4 class="modal-heading">User Experience</h4>
    <p class="modal-text">The interface is built around clear navigation and product presentation, so visitors can move from browsing to checkout with minimal friction.</p>

    <h4 class="modal-heading">Product Discovery</h4>
    <p class="modal-text">Product cards and category organization help visitors scan and find what they're looking for quickly.</p>

    <h4 class="modal-heading">Shopping Experience</h4>
    <p class="modal-text">A streamlined shopping flow — from viewing a product to completing a purchase — designed to feel simple on both desktop and mobile.</p>

    <h4 class="modal-heading">Technology</h4>
    <p class="modal-text">Full technology breakdown for TouchTech Hub is still being finalized for public write-up — this section will be updated with confirmed stack details.</p>

    <h4 class="modal-heading">Challenges</h4>
    <p class="modal-text">Balancing a visually engaging storefront with fast, predictable interactions, and making sure the shopping flow holds up across screen sizes.</p>

